  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3107.04 Protocol Content",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3107.04 Protocol Content. A protocol may contain the following:\n\n(a) Emission quantification methods contained in an applicable Federally approved operating permit; or\n\n(b) Emission quantification methods approved in the applicable SIP.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
